cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its datasets, please cite it as below."
title: "Overthink Conjecture Engine"
abstract: >-
  A falsification-first discovery loop for combinatorial game theory:
  compute exact game data, mine it for conjectures, aggressively try to
  refute them, formalize survivors in Lean 4, and record everything in an
  open dataset.
type: software
